      "id": 151,
      "options": {
        "content": "<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#c7ccd1\"><b style='color:#e6e9ed'>NCCL / collective validation \u2014 area home.</b> <span style='color:#B77D34'>Scope note:</span> no collective-benchmark exporter is currently producing (there is no live source of bus bandwidth or collective latency on this stack), so this area reports what the trays themselves can prove: which GPUs are carrying NVLink traffic, and whether any of them is throwing interconnect errors while doing it. Everything below is measured, not inferred.<div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-llmb-validation\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">Live Job &amp; GPU Telemetry</a><a href=\"/d/nvis-l2-llmb-validation\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">LLMB Area Home</a><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-llmb-deepseek\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">Run Drill-Down \u00b7 GPU Compute</a><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-llmb-nemotron\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">Run Drill-Down \u00b7 Host &amp; Memory</a><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#2a3f2a;border:1px solid #3d5a3d;color:#a8c8a8;font-weight:600\">NCCL Area Home</span><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-nccl-validation\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">NCCL Runs \u00b7 NVLink &amp; Interconnect</a><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-nccl-acceptance-matrix\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">Collective Run Coverage Matrix</a></div></div>",
        "mode": "html"
